  _npcID: Master
  _npcName: Master
  _npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd2e2ace41cfa1c4285dd4a17656c106, type: 3}
  _dialogueLines:
  - "\u2026It can\u2019t be\u2026 Those eyes\u2026 that stance\u2026 Is it really
    you?"
  - "So it\u2019s true\u2026 you\u2019ve lost your memories."
  - "I am your Master, the village chief. I watched you grow up\u2026"
  - "It\u2019s alright. Even if you\u2019ve forgotten us\u2026 we never forgot you."
  - "You were the pride of this village. Fast, determined\u2026 but always carrying
    something heavy inside your heart."
  - "Your final mission involved an enemy who used forbidden techniques. Memory loss\u2026
    is one of their cruel signatures."
  - "Fear from the past lingers. You disappeared during a terrible betrayal. They
    don\u2019t fear you \u2014 they fear the wounds that event left behind."
  - Return to the Northern Ruins, where you vanished years ago. Your memories may
    still be waiting there.
  - More than you can imagine. To me, you were like family.
  - "Rest for now. Tomorrow\u2026 we begin the journey to find who you truly are."
  - Don't woory about anything. Take a rest.
  _typingSpeed: 0.05
  _voiceSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8548c7132559e4640a291ff63ca5d81f, type: 3}
  _voicePitch: 1
